This demo anthology contains 29+ minutes of French Touch demos
released between 2014 and 2024!

You can run them individually or in automatic mode! Wow!

But sorry, not NTSC compatibility. We need the refresh rate
to be 50Hz in most of our recent prods!


-------+ Requirements +-------
Apple IIe PAL:
    Mockingboard or compatible card
	128kB RAM
	Liron card or compatible
	800kB Unidisk drive or compatible block device/floppy emulator

Apple IIc PAL:
	Mockingboard 4C or 4C+
	ROM 0 or later
	800kB Unidisk drive or compatible block device/floppy emulator
	

